	measure 'Strongest T1~Kp r' = VAR r = MAX ( MAX ( MAX ( ABS ( [r T1 vs Kp · lag 0d] ), ABS ( [r T1 vs Kp · lag 1d] ) ), MAX ( ABS ( [r T1 vs Kp · lag 2d] ), ABS ( [r T1 vs Kp · lag 3d] ) ) ), MAX ( ABS ( [r T1 vs Kp · lag 5d] ), ABS ( [r T1 vs Kp · lag 7d] ) ) ) RETURN IF ( r = 0, BLANK (), r )
		formatString: 0.00
